        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Asa yumvise ayo majambo, ayo mwene Odedi yavugishijwe, arema mu mutima, akūrah’ ibizira vy’ubuyobe mu gihugu cose c’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini, no mu bisagara yihesheje umuheto vyo mu mugamba w’ Abefurayimu; yongera guhagarika igicaniro cār’ imbere y’urubaraza rw’ingoro y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
