          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Abayuda bose iyo ndahiro irabanezereza, kuko bari barahiye bīvuye inyuma, bakarondera Uhoraho n’umwete wabo wose, bakamubona; maz’ Uhoraho abaha kugira umutēkāno impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
