        {
          "text": "Kandi yinjiza mu ngoro y’ Imana ibintu se yari yaratanze kw inyegu, n’ivyo yatanze kw inyegu na we ubgiwe, amafeza n’amazahabu n’ibintu vy’ibikoreshwa. ",
